# PSS Production Support Automation Platform – Sherlock

## 1. Overview

The **PSS Production Support Automation Platform (Sherlock)** is an automation solution designed to simplify and standardize day-to-day production support activities for the PSS Wealth support team.

The platform brings frequently performed support activities into a **single Teams-based interface**, allowing support members to retrieve information, track incidents, automate handover activities, and receive important notifications with minimal manual intervention.

The solution uses **Microsoft Teams, Power Automate, SharePoint, Excel and Outlook** to automate repetitive operational activities and provide information to the support team when it is required.

### Key Objectives

* Reduce repetitive manual work performed by the PSS support team.
* Provide faster access to ETL, ingestion and incident information.
* Automate shift handover activities.
* Reduce dependency on manually searching multiple files, emails and systems.
* Standardize support processes and notifications.
* Maintain operational information in centralized SharePoint-based datasets.
* Improve response time and consistency during production support activities.

---

# 2. Solution at a Glance

The platform follows a simple model:

**Teams → Sherlock → Power Automate Flows → SharePoint / Excel / Outlook → Teams / Email Notifications**

The support team interacts primarily through the **Teams group chat**, while Power Automate performs the required backend processing.

### High-Level Components

| Component               | Purpose                                                        |
| ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Microsoft Teams**     | Primary interface for PSS users                                |
| **Sherlock ChatBot**    | Receives commands and triggers required automation             |
| **Power Automate**      | Orchestrates automation and business logic                     |
| **SharePoint**          | Central location for operational datasets and automation files |
| **Excel**               | Stores structured master/support data                          |
| **Outlook**             | Source for operational emails and notification mechanism       |
| **Teams Notifications** | Provides real-time information and alerts to support teams     |

---

# 3. Sherlock – Central Support Automation

**Sherlock** acts as the common entry point for multiple PSS support automations.

Instead of manually navigating through SharePoint folders, Excel files, emails and other sources, users can trigger the required functionality directly from the Teams group chat.

### Current capabilities include

* Incident information retrieval and tracking
* ETL job information lookup
* Ingestion/entity information lookup
* Dependency identification
* FileWatcher-related information
* Entity threshold information
* Automated handover updates
* HO email automation
* ETL group-wise HO updates
* Automated email-based alerts

The platform can also be extended with additional commands and support automations in the future.

